// Which working queue a lead lives in — not a funnel stage. STANDARD is the
// normal, staff-worked pipeline (Leads page/dashboard/reports). IMPORT_REVIEW
// is a holding area for bulk-imported batches with data-quality problems
// (missing contact info, unverified stages) that need staff review/cleanup
// before they're trusted enough to show up alongside real leads. Promoting a
// lead just flips this back to STANDARD — everything else about it (stage,
// activities, follow-ups, ledger) carries over unchanged.
enum LeadPipelineSegment {
  STANDARD
  IMPORT_REVIEW
}

